'''Trainspotting''' (撮り鉄, ''Tori Tetsu'', '''Trainspotting''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Cannon Start Level UP (Sm): Cannon gauge will be filled +2 steps/20% charged.

